    {
      "type": "tutorial",
      "heading": "Classification Tabs",
      "id": "classification-tabs",
      "intro": "Gunakan tab klasifikasi untuk memfilter alert berdasarkan status fraud. Sistem menggunakan 3 klasifikasi utama + view All.",
      "steps": [
        {
          "num": 1,
          "title": "Tab All Alerts",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• Menampilkan semua alert tanpa filter klasifikasi\n• Default view saat pertama membuka halaman\n• Berguna untuk overview keseluruhan alert\n• Data mencakup NEGATIVE, SUSPICIOUS, dan POSITIVE",
          "color": "#3b82f6",
          "bg": "#eff6ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.04),0 1px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.06);background:#fff;border:1px solid #bfdbfe;overflow:hidden;\"><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #eff6ff;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-bottom:8px;\"><div style=\"width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:8px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#3b82f6,#2563eb);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\"><svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><path d=\"M4 7v10c0 2 1 3 3 3h10c2 0 3-1 3-3V7c0-2-1-3-3-3H7C5 4 4 5 4 7z\"/></svg></div><span style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">All Alerts</span></div></div><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap;\"><span style=\"padding:3px 10px;border-radius:5px;background:#f0fdf4;border:1px solid #bbf7d0;font-size:9px;font-weight:600;color:#16a34a;\">NEGATIVE</span><span style=\"padding:3px 10px;border-radius:5px;background:#fffbeb;border:1px solid #fde68a;font-size:9px;font-weight:600;color:#f59e0b;\">SUSPICIOUS</span><span style=\"padding:3px 10px;border-radius:5px;background:#fef2f2;border:1px solid #fecaca;font-size:9px;font-weight:600;color:#dc2626;\">POSITIVE</span></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 2,
          "title": "Tab Not Fraud (NEGATIVE)",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• Alert yang sudah dikonfirmasi bukan fraud\n• Status: NEGATIVE\n• Biasanya hasil dari false positive\n• Bisa digunakan untuk training model ML",
          "color": "#16a34a",
          "bg": "#f0fdf4",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.04),0 1px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.06);background:#fff;border:1px solid #bbf7d0;overflow:hidden;\"><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #f0fdf4;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-bottom:6px;\"><div style=\"width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:8px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#16a34a,#15803d);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\"><svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><path d=\"M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z\"/></svg></div><span style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">Not Fraud</span></div><span style=\"padding:3px 12px;border-radius:6px;background:#f0fdf4;border:1px solid #86efac;font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#16a34a;text-transform:uppercase;\">NEGATIVE</span></div><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;font-size:10px;color:#64748b;line-height:1.5;\">Alert yang telah diverifikasi dan dipastikan bukan merupakan aktivitas fraud. False positive dari detection rule.</div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 3,
          "title": "Tab Suspicious",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• Alert yang mencurigakan dan perlu review\n• Status: SUSPICIOUS\n• Memerlukan investigasi lebih lanjut oleh analyst\n• Belum dipastikan apakah fraud atau bukan\n• Priority untuk tim fraud analyst",
          "color": "#f59e0b",
          "bg": "#fffbeb",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.04),0 1px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.06);background:#fff;border:1px solid #fde68a;overflow:hidden;\"><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #fffbeb;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-bottom:6px;\"><div style=\"width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:8px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f59e0b,#d97706);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\"><svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><path d=\"M12 9v2m0 4h.01m-6.938 4h13.856c1.54 0 2.502-1.667 1.732-3L13.732 4c-.77-1.333-2.694-1.333-3.464 0L3.34 16c-.77 1.333.192 3 1.732 3z\"/></svg></div><span style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">Suspicious</span></div><span style=\"padding:3px 12px;border-radius:6px;background:#fffbeb;border:1px solid #fcd34d;font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#f59e0b;text-transform:uppercase;\">⚠️ Perlu Review</span></div><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;font-size:10px;color:#64748b;line-height:1.5;\">Alert dengan indikasi mencurigakan yang memerlukan analisis mendalam. Prioritas tinggi untuk investigasi fraud analyst.</div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 4,
          "title": "Tab Fraud (POSITIVE)",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• Alert yang sudah dikonfirmasi sebagai fraud\n• Status: POSITIVE\n• Memerlukan action segera (block, refund, report)\n• Data untuk improve detection rule\n• Highest priority untuk mitigation",
          "color": "#dc2626",
          "bg": "#fef2f2",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.04),0 1px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.06);background:#fff;border:1px solid #fecaca;overflow:hidden;\"><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #fef2f2;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-bottom:6px;\"><div style=\"width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:8px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#dc2626,#b91c1c);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\"><svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><path d=\"M10 14l2-2m0 0l2-2m-2 2l-2-2m2 2l2 2m7-2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z\"/></svg></div><span style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">Fraud</span></div><span style=\"padding:3px 12px;border-radius:6px;background:#fef2f2;border:1px solid #fca5a5;font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#dc2626;text-transform:uppercase;\">🚨 POSITIVE</span></div><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;font-size:10px;color:#64748b;line-height:1.5;\">Alert terverifikasi sebagai fraud. Membutuhkan action mitigation segera: block account, stop transaction, atau escalate ke authority.</div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 5,
          "title": "Cara Switch Tab",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• Klik tab yang diinginkan di bagian atas tabel\n• Data akan otomatis ter-refresh dengan filter baru\n• Loading indicator muncul saat fetch data\n• Pagination akan reset ke halaman 1\n• Search & filter tetap dipertahankan (optional)",
          "color": "#6366f1",
          "bg": "#eef2ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.04),0 1px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.06);background:#fff;border:1px solid #c7d2fe;overflow:hidden;padding:14px 16px;\"><div style=\"display:flex;gap:6px;margin-bottom:10px;justify-content:center;\"><div style=\"flex:1;border-radius:11px;border:2px solid #6366f1;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#eef2ff,#fff);padding:10px;\"><div style=\"font-size:10px;color:#4f46e5;font-weight:700;text-align:center;\">All</div></div><div style=\"flex:1;border-radius:11px;border:1.5px solid #e2e8f0;background:#f8fafc;padding:10px;opacity:.6;\"><div style=\"font-size:10px;color:#64748b;font-weight:600;text-align:center;\">Not Fraud</div></div><div style=\"flex:1;border-radius:11px;border:1.5px solid #e2e8f0;background:#f8fafc;padding:10px;opacity:.6;\"><div style=\"font-size:10px;color:#64748b;font-weight:600;text-align:center;\">Suspicious</div></div><div style=\"flex:1;border-radius:11px;border:1.5px solid #e2e8f0;background:#f8fafc;padding:10px;opacity:.6;\"><div style=\"font-size:10px;color:#64748b;font-weight:600;text-align:center;\">Fraud</div></div></div><div style=\"text-align:center;font-size:10px;color:#64748b;line-height:1.5;\">Klik tab untuk filter alert berdasarkan klasifikasi. Data refresh otomatis.</div></div>"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
